## Project objective

Develop a centralized web-based platform that digitizes waste collection operations.

The platform must allow citizens to register their households, submit waste pickup requests, schedule regular collections, and monitor request status.

Municipal administrators and collection supervisors must be able to manage locations, schedules, collectors, pickup assignments, and operational reports.

Waste collectors must be able to view their assigned pickups, update collection statuses, and record completed or missed collections.

The system must provide transparent waste management operations, efficient collection scheduling, and performance monitoring.

